{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the threat of complete destruction, a jester travels to world\u2019s end to find their chance at survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>VERIVENTURE</strong>, you can build, share and play dungeons online in the editor, created from over 50 level pieces. In the land of Eden, at the edge of the world, an interconnected, labyrinthine oubliette lies dormant, hiding many enemies, puzzles, and secrets within its halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/e1eb7035ef9057279b9f8e62e6078223.poster.avif?t=1753521235\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/e1eb7035ef9057279b9f8e62e6078223.webm?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/e1eb7035ef9057279b9f8e62e6078223.mp4?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your dungeons, built from rooms connected together on an endless grid. There are 50+ pieces for you to make levels within the editor, ranging across categories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layout</strong> pieces build the foundations of your dungeon\u2019s design, like Doors and Trapdoors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickups</strong> are new items and abilities, or the containers that hold them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazards</strong> act as an obstacle to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong> are the components of a combat encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle</strong> pieces create networks of signals and conditions the player can manipulate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorative</strong> pieces add some variety to your creations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARE WHAT YOU MAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/00518c276dd01d08313b56000a7d2453.poster.avif?t=1753521235\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/00518c276dd01d08313b56000a7d2453.webm?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/00518c276dd01d08313b56000a7d2453.mp4?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your dungeons online to be played by others, or search for dungeons that others have made to play yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE EDEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Eden, situated at the edge of the universe. Talk to locals, learn about the circumstances which have led you here, and complete  mini-games and activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENTURE INTO THE OUBLIETTE IN THE ORB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the story inside a giant oubliette where interconnecting zones weave together on a massive map as you venture deeper to reach your prize, sleeping deep below.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878300?t=1753521235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3878300?t=1753521235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/074cc9a6834daeef60d899c8e7f7acee7318e07e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753521235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/074cc9a6834daeef60d899c8e7f7acee7318e07e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753521235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the threat of complete destruction, a jester travels to world\u2019s end to find their chance at survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>VERIVENTURE</strong>, you can build, share and play dungeons online in the editor, created from over 50 level pieces. In the land of Eden, at the edge of the world, an interconnected, labyrinthine oubliette lies dormant, hiding many enemies, puzzles, and secrets within its halls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CREATE DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/e1eb7035ef9057279b9f8e62e6078223.poster.avif?t=1753521235\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/e1eb7035ef9057279b9f8e62e6078223.webm?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/e1eb7035ef9057279b9f8e62e6078223.mp4?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your dungeons, built from rooms connected together on an endless grid. There are 50+ pieces for you to make levels within the editor, ranging across categories.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Layout</strong> pieces build the foundations of your dungeon\u2019s design, like Doors and Trapdoors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pickups</strong> are new items and abilities, or the containers that hold them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazards</strong> act as an obstacle to the player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies</strong> are the components of a combat encounter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle</strong> pieces create networks of signals and conditions the player can manipulate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decorative</strong> pieces add some variety to your creations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHARE WHAT YOU MAKE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/00518c276dd01d08313b56000a7d2453.poster.avif?t=1753521235\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/00518c276dd01d08313b56000a7d2453.webm?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878300/extras/00518c276dd01d08313b56000a7d2453.mp4?t=1753521235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upload your dungeons online to be played by others, or search for dungeons that others have made to play yourself.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE EDEN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the town of Eden, situated at the edge of the universe. Talk to locals, learn about the circumstances which have led you here, and complete  mini-games and activities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >VENTURE INTO THE OUBLIETTE IN THE ORB</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through the story inside a giant oubliette where interconnecting zones weave together on a massive map as you venture deeper to reach your prize, sleeping deep below.</p>","develop